 ## Retries
 
+The worker retries a failed delivery until the endpoint accepts it. There is no
+limit by default, so a permanently broken endpoint keeps its deliveries in the
+queue until an operator drains it.
+
+Set `RETRY_MAX` to cap the number of attempts:
+
+    export RETRY_MAX=5
+
 Failed deliveries are written to the dead-letter queue.
 
